## 2. 责任主体详细流程图

### 2.1 llh负责：pre/post支路

```mermaid
graph TB
    %% ========== 输入层（原始输入+依赖输入）==========
    subgraph Input [输入层]
        O1[grad_hin<br/>原始输入<br/>B,S,D]
        O2[grad_h_post<br/>原始输入<br/>B,S,N]
        O3[x<br/>原始输入<br/>B,S,N,D]
        O4[h_pre<br/>原始输入<br/>B,S,N]
        O5[hc_before_norm<br/>原始输入<br/>B,S,N²+2N]
        O6[inv_rms<br/>原始输入<br/>B,S,1]
        O7[alpha<br/>原始输入<br/>3]
        O8[bias<br/>原始输入<br/>N²+2N]
    end

    %% ========== 计算流程 ==========
    subgraph Computation [计算流程]
        C1[输入聚合梯度<br/>grad_x_from_hin = grad_hin · h_pre<br/>输出: B,S,N,D<br/>grad_h_pre = grad_hin · x.sum<br/>输出: B,S,N]
        
        C2[正向中间变量<br/>norm_out_forward = hc · inv_rms<br/>输出: B,S,N²+2N<br/>拆分: part1,part2,part3<br/>线性: z_pre,z_post,z_res]
        
        C3[pre/post激活梯度<br/>grad_z_pre = SigmoidGrad<br/>输出: B,S,N<br/>grad_z_post = 2·SigmoidGrad<br/>输出: B,S,N]
        
        C4[pre/post alpha梯度<br/>grad_alpha_pre = part1·grad_z.sum<br/>输出: scalar<br/>grad_alpha_post = part2·grad_z.sum<br/>输出: scalar]
        
        C5[pre/post bias梯度<br/>grad_bias_part1 = grad_z.sum<br/>输出: N<br/>grad_bias_part2 = grad_z.sum<br/>输出: N]
    end

    %% ========== 输出层（供后续责任人）==========
    subgraph Output [输出层]
        Out1[grad_x_from_hin<br/>→ lhp矩阵乘法]
        Out2[grad_z_pre<br/>→ lhp线性变换]
        Out3[grad_z_post<br/>→ lhp线性变换]
        Out4[z_res<br/>→ hbj Sinkhorn]
        Out5[norm_out_forward_part3<br/>→ hbj alpha梯度]
        Out6[grad_alpha_pre<br/>→ zyf组装]
        Out7[grad_alpha_post<br/>→ zyf组装]
        Out8[grad_bias_part1<br/>→ zyf组装]
        Out9[grad_bias_part2<br/>→ zyf组装]
    end

    %% ========== 连线 ==========
    O1 --> C1
    O3 --> C1
    O4 --> C1
    
    O5 --> C2
    O6 --> C2
    O7 --> C2
    O8 --> C2
    C1 --> C2
    
    O2 --> C3
    C2 --> C3
    
    C2 --> C4
    C3 --> C4
    
    C3 --> C5
    
    C1 --> Out1
    C3 --> Out2
    C3 --> Out3
    C2 --> Out4
    C2 --> Out5
    C4 --> Out6
    C4 --> Out7
    C5 --> Out8
    C5 --> Out9

    %% ========== 样式 ==========
    classDef input fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1976d2,stroke-width:2px
    classDef compute fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f57f17,stroke-width:2px
    classDef output fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#388e3c,stroke-width:2px

    class O1,O2,O3,O4,O5,O6,O7,O8 input
    class C1,C2,C3,C4,C5 compute
    class Out1,Out2,Out3,Out4,Out5,Out6,Out7,Out8,Out9 output
```

### 2.2 hbj负责：res支路

```mermaid
graph TB
    %% ========== 输入层 ==========
    subgraph Input [输入层]
